{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"`Can't you make your hat just do the thing?`","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:05:35.274000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879275164142022726","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Thanks.' she smiles, before turning her head to face Orphy, 'I'm not completely sure how reliable it is. It feels like it might easily run out of magic.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:07:49.579000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879275727458009128","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"`Yeah, some mental fine print about 'ACME Hat Co is not responsible for any injuries or death caused by usage of this product.'`","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:09:02.389000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879276032845299754","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"`You think it would fit on my head?` He flies around Sabrine, inspecting it. `Nah. Too big. It would probably fit if me, Kuk, and probably Eurus all stood side by side and you put the hat on us.`","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:10:37.781000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879276432948363264","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"`Nah, I think your head's inflated enough for it to fit fine.` they grab another hat and put it on Orphy's head - it's too big.","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:11:57.907000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879276769021165589","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
