{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"Orphy chases after it. `Get inside my mouth, amphibian!`","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:17:27.795000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879278152671711295","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'...should I be offended?'","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:17:45.692000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879278227737178142","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"`You're too big to eat and I've already given up on an insect diet.` Orphy finally catches up to the small frog and eats cleanly.","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:18:56.094000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879278523024556075","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Well, I guess it's life. At least the giant frog spit me back out.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:19:56.958000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879278778306670613","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"Kukudh falls prey to curiosity and swipes a bit of frog. `Ugh. This tastes bad.`","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:20:40.632000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879278961488703488","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"`It's an acquired taste.`","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:21:37.817000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879279201339977749","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"`You've never really known anything besides breadcrumbs and bagels. Hope it stays that way though.`","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:22:17.094000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879279366079651890","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'I mean... we ate prestidigitated dirt for a while. They just don't remember it.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:22:56.253000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879279530324394035","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'It was the best I could do to at least attempt to quell the hunger when I was first, ah, revived.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:23:44.344000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879279732032696351","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I thought you didn't need food then?\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:25:54.376000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879280277426413609","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'I didn't. But I still felt like I did. And I couldn't stop it.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:26:18.586000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879280378970521650","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'...I hope if I ever run into anyone like... I used to be... I can help them.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:26:57.785000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879280543383056436","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"Irynx nods.","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:27:41.380000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879280726233727016","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Whether that's helping them adjust to the body they're in, or helping them gain a new one...' she hesitates slightly before continuing, '...or, if they'd prefer, like if they were brought back against their will, putting them to rest.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:31:01.291000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879281564721233970","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'It's a tough conflict in these cases, between living each day and the mercy of rest, but... I feel like ultimately, if the person is reborn into pain and suffering, and all other options have failed, it may be better to just let them rest... I'll have to talk to Gil about it, but I feel like he would agree with me for the most extreme of situations.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:33:48.150000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879282264578596874","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"That rest is a good mercy. Peaceful. Not that I've ever known it in all my years.\" Orphy finally settles on her shoulder again.","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:35:43.905000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879282750090252359","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I hope we won't run into many such cases further west. The more west, the smaller the effects of the influence of redcoats should be.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:36:19.706000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879282900250546176","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"The west is the wilds, as far as I know. I've gone up and down the coasts but I've never travelled that far in land.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:37:38.208000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879283229511811123","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'I hope so. But since I don't know the exact cause of my case... it could have been redcoats, it could have been the ***Thing***, it could have been a scientist like Heore, all I know is that it wasn't natural. So it's something I need to keep in the back of my mind, just in case.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:38:29.041000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879283442720833546","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Still, the wilds wouldn't be touched as much. By definition, really.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:40:50.615000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879284036525260800","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"she nods. 'We need to be careful, then. Find a good balance of spreading faith so that we don't just... wipe out any that already exists. Who knows what sort of people could be out there, that we could learn so much from?'","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:41:45.349000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879284266096283648","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Irynx, you know more than me about this - do you know if it's possible to be a member of multiple faiths at once, if they don't have clashing ideals?'","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:43:06.575000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879284606782832650","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Hmm...\" she thinks about it. \"Well, there are a lot of powers in this world. It's very rare for me actually to see people devoted only to a single one. Most cases, it's a matter of preference. You might ask one to spare your home from a coming storm, then later offer prayers to another for a bountiful harvest or for safety on a journey. No one thing governs all things.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:47:50.625000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879285798174859296","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"she nods. 'So it should be reasonable, then. And, ah, I guess prevents us from having a conflict of interest.' she laughs slightly, a little embarrassed.","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:49:05.063000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879286110390460467","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Can't have too much of any one thing without balance with the rest.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:52:53.918000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879287070277918731","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"`Yeah, we don't want 7.8 out of 10 too much water.`","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:53:22.588000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879287190528598036","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"`No offense, kid, but I comprehended none of that.`","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:55:29.914000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879287724572553216","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'They mean, if everything were water, no land, it would be difficult for a lot of life to survive. And the same the other way - land without water would be even more catastrophic.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:57:03.898000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879288118770008114","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'We need the balance.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:57:16.070000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879288169823088680","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"The ocean and the trees,\" Irynx nods.","created_at":"2021-08-23T08:57:35.351000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879288250693480458","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Oh - when you go west, I guess Willow will be taking care of the grove? We'll need to find someone to look after the park...'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:03:33.724000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879289753818771456","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I was never really priestess of the grove. I only took care of the tree because, well, if it wasn't obvious, trees mean a lot to me. It needed care, so I gave it.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:04:49.944000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879290073508642847","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"(I have ~~injokes~~ ~~cameos~~ candidates in mind that literally just V and I will know, so if we don't think of anything better then whoops my shiny gyarados/mythological Hercules figure (and/or his daughter) is here :v)\n'Makes sense. Still, the park is more of a public place... someone will need to be there to help upkeep.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:07:29.765000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879290743846473728","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I believe someone will come and take care of the park, because the park will need it. Surely, someone else in this city must care that much.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:07:52.249000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879290838151204894","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Absolutely. Still, I'd like to be sure of it before leaving. The park is my responsibility... I can't leave without being certain it'll be cared for.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:08:46.883000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879291067302838282","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"....You think Grimlock will join us on our journey?\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:09:44.433000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879291308685021215","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"(i mean, i do already have permission so the answer is yes)","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:10:34.372000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879291518144356392","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"(awakened grimmy when)\nshe shrugs. 'Who knows? Grimmy does what she likes.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:10:51.019000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879291587966935061","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"If we ask her, maybe? Also I'm sure we'll find some trusted people to look after the park. Perhaps the night shift needs more members.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:10:51.186000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879291588667396156","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'The more people we can get to help out, the better. I don't want anyone to get overworked.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:15:19.580000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879292714393411594","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Oh, true. You could probably sort this out into an almost pyramid scheme, where you always have to bring a friend into the fold.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:19:12.872000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879293692890996736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'I don't want people to feel they have to bring someone else in, though.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:20:28.443000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879294009858740264","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I wasn't that serious with the suggestion either.\"\n\n`I'll admit, it was my idea.`","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:21:17.020000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879294213605425192","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"`Should've guessed.`","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:21:22.562000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879294236850278411","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"she laughs slightly. 'Honestly, I was thinking the opposite - even if someone comes into the group without a friend, I want them to find friends there.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:21:51.633000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879294358782869534","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I mean, what's the best way to mend than to create a really strong network... Hm. The metaphor is getting lost here.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:22:52.892000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879294615721771089","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"Roy shrugs. \"We'll find what we need when we get to that point.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:23:47.682000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879294845527658506","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Is it not your task right now to find people anyway?\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:24:51.335000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879295112507699200","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Ideally, the group taking care of the park would also help taking care of others when we're away. I'd like to set up food, shelter, and other things people might need, for whatever they can afford to pay. So we'll need to find some people who can cast goodberry, who can cast create water...'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:24:52.982000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879295119415705610","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Though, anyone who gets power from Gil the same way I did will definitely be able to cast those. So hopefully I'll be able to find an apprentice, at the very least.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:26:30.883000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879295530042273822","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
