{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"(honestly if he homebrews that I will 100% play it, at least to test)\n'Perhaps he gave you some power as well?'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:29:09.582000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879296195674116156","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Druids draw from nature itself and... hm, well. That's basically the agreement since Mr. Gil became a Warden. Maybe you're a druid now.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:29:43.563000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-23T09:31:04.914000Z","id":"879296338200772618","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"The swarm gives me just things I know. This is more like I can draw these from nature as I need. Like the druids from neighboring lands to my home town, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:30:41.691000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879296582007287829","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"`Am I so beautiful you've no words left?`\n'Shh.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:31:38.123000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879296818700255263","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Is that from some story I don't know?\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:34:09.958000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879297455542378527","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Orphy and I are just talking.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:34:21.548000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879297504154365992","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Probably is. They know fragments of a lot of stories... I'm not sure where from. Perhaps... things I read in childhood...'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:34:52.493000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879297633947123722","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"she shrugs. 'I don't know. Druid is a term I haven't really heard of, but it sounds like it fits?'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:38:18.425000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879298497688510504","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"We had a lot of druids where I grew up. Since we valued the ocean and the trees and all. I wanted to be one but, just didn't have the talent for it.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:39:38.961000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879298835480969256","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I guess you could say druids are kinda like clerics but for nature? I'm probably simplifying it a lot, but back home that's basically how we saw that.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:40:23.127000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879299020726612020","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"(*laughs in nature cleric*)\n'Honestly, I'm not even sure what I am. Besides priestess.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:41:28.641000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879299295512260709","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"You're Sabrine, silly.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:41:42.297000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879299352789651496","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Well, yes, but--- I mean in terms of job titles.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:41:52.537000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879299395739349054","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Though now I think about it, I don't know the name of...' she gestures vaguely at herself. 'Frogginess. It might be useful to know.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:42:28.998000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879299548667863100","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Orphy, do you know?\"\n\nShrug.","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:44:28.209000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879300048675012618","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Well, I can always ask at the library at some point. It's not high priority.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:45:04.885000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879300202505310249","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"You'll definitely meet some on our travels, that's for sure.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:45:23.303000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879300279756009482","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'My main concern is that I don't know how long my lifespan is, but at the same time... I don't know how much of it I've used, either. So all the more reason to not worry and live for the day.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:45:51.806000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879300399306244149","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"despite that, she does look a little worried.","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:46:01.327000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879300439240237058","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"Irynx sighs. \"I suppose I should worry about that, too. Especially since I gave some years away to the fey.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:46:32.164000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879300568579993619","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Nobody really knows their lifespan for sure. Unless there's some magic for that. There's *always* some magic for some things. I don't know if I'd want to know though.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:46:55.696000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879300667280326688","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"she nods. 'I wouldn't want to know exactly, either.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:47:20.505000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879300771336818769","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"That's why we just live,\" Irynx shrugs. \"Isn't that one of the Mender's tenets? Seize the day.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:47:59.656000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879300935548043284","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Exactly.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:48:04.944000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879300957727510558","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'That one... was probably the most difficult for me to originally grasp. But I think I've got it.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:49:10.753000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879301233750470727","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Yeah, same.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:49:27.760000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879301305082978305","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Maybe he put them in the order of increasing difficulty.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:49:41.708000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879301363585138748","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Would make sense. Having the easiest ones first means people can work their way there.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:50:28.144000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879301558351822889","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I suppose I can't speak to the difficulty of that given I'm eight hundred years old.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:50:33.867000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879301582355836929","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Life, mercy, freedom, nature, the fifth one. Yeah, to be honest, I'm not sure if they're ordered like that. Or maybe they just aren't meant to be.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:52:11.433000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879301991577321503","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'What's it like, living that long?'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:53:23.774000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879302294997458984","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'With my, ah, few months of actual experience... I can't even start to imagine it.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:53:44.508000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879302381962141696","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Strange. I'm full of memories but at the same time, I'm not.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:55:24.930000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-23T10:06:05.687000Z","id":"879302803162558484","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I live my life the way I do because of everything that's happened to me. I am.... haunted, by life. Its terrors, its beauties. There's so much of life.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:56:31.153000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-23T10:06:20.784000Z","id":"879303080921956374","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"How would I describe living this long? It gives you an awareness of how temporary things can be. Maybe that's why seizing the day isn't that hard for me. Things will come and things will go.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:58:15.277000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879303517649633320","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Maybe that's why it was so much more difficult for us, then.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T09:58:54.680000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879303682917818428","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"She nods. \"You've lived so far in permanent things. Even with all the change going on in this city.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:00:23.944000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879304057318170694","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'I mean - I've had a couple of months here, and a couple of months before that... getting here. Not that I remember much from the start.'","created_at":"2021-08-23T10:01:04.947000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879304229297192970","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
